<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Power in prayer, Lord, power in prayer!</l><l>Here ’mid earth’s sin and sorrow and care,</l><l>Men lost and dying, souls in despair;</l><l>O give me power, power in prayer!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>My weakened will, Lord, Thou canst renew;</l><l>My sinful nature Thou canst subdue;</l><l>Fill me just now with power anew;</l><l>Power to pray and power to do!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Teach me to pray, Lord, teach me to pray;</l><l>Thou art my pattern day unto day;</l><l>Thou art my surety, now and for aye;</l><l>Teach me to pray, Lord, teach me to pray.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
